WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.816
This is a safe place.

2
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.056
What do you mean?
Just what your mum used to call it.

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.016
DYLAN: It's all over socials -
that you killed her.

4
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.176
It's all your fault.
and it's being taken out on me.

5
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.856
What you gonna do?
Get your dad to kill me?

6
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.256
He'll probably get his dad
to shag you.

7
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.576
Alana hasn't gone
to her grandparents to help them.

8
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.376
she's gone to get away from me.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.696
Sarah's death is my fault.

10
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.976
The 24th. 25th and the 26th.

11
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.536
Can anyone explain
where Michael was?

12
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.176
Alana? I don't know!

13
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.056
I saw Polly in a fight
with one of the boys.

14
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.296
"Fight". as in handbags.
like grabbing and shoving?

15
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.496
This wasn't just handbags.
as you call it.

16
00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.496
it was violent abuse.

17
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.256
Craig. listen to me.
do not come here. I am at work.

18
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.656
Please. Is that him?

19
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.856
I'll go and speak to him now.

20
00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:46.656
He just gets so bloody angry.
Angry?

21
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.136
Do yourself a favour and go back...

22
00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.616
Take your hands off me! Agh!
THEY GRUNT.

23
00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:52.400
Is that what you want?
Craig. please stop.

24
00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.856
No-one's saying he did it.
that's not what I said.

25
00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.256
but they're asking questions.

26
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:02.296
What sort of questions?
Past behaviour.

27
00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:05.240
Rory said he saw him in some
kind of fight on the rugby pitch.

28
00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.736
I'm just telling you
what I heard. Alana.

29
00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.240
Let's get your stuff
and come stay with me.

30
00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:19.200
CLAMOURING

31
00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.640
Agh! Agh. agh!

32
00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:28.296
Dad! Dad! Alana. wait!

33
00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.336
I haven't done anything!
Get him inside the house.

34
00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.896
Get him inside the house. Agh!

35
00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.176
Dad. Dad!
It's all right. it's all right.

36
00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.760
Calm down. Agh!

37
00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:39.640
Ridiculous!

38
00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:44.576
I have done nothing wrong!

39
00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.816
HANDCUFFS CLICK Agh! Oh!

40
00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:49.336
You should be arresting him. not me.

41
00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:51.096
Charlie-X-ray-three-five-six.

42
00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.776
can I get an ETA
on that back-up. please?

43
00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.896
What the hell was that?

44
00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.896
You had your hand
around his neck. Michael.

45
00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.240
People are gonna think
you were trying to strangle him.

46
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:07.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
